# Netlify redirect rules.
#
# This site is a plain static deploy of the repo root: every committed
# non-dotfile ships to the CDN and is reachable by URL. (Dotfiles such as
# .gitignore and .claude/ are skipped by Netlify automatically and need no
# rule here.) These rules return a 404 for project scaffolding that is in the
# repo but is not part of the website.
#
# The trailing ! is required. Without it Netlify serves the matching file and
# ignores the rule — static files win over redirects unless the rule is forced.
#
# Rule of thumb: anything the site actually serves must NOT be listed here.
# When the pottery gallery lands, pottery/ img/pottery/ and css/pottery.css
# stay off this list; scripts/ and package.json stay on it.

/README.md          /404.html  404!
/AGENTS.md          /404.html  404!
/CLAUDE.md          /404.html  404!
/docs/*             /404.html  404!
/scripts/*          /404.html  404!
/package.json       /404.html  404!
/package-lock.json  /404.html  404!
